{"id": "EUVD-2026-96554", "enisaUuid": "42983442-91ac-35d0-bb79-e5efd9ea181e", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the AiragExtDataController delete handler that allows low-privileged authenticated users to delete AI evaluator records. Attackers can send DELETE requests to /airag/extData/delete with any id parameter to remove other users' AI evaluator or test-tracking records without owner or tenant checks.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:15", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:02:23", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_airag_extdata_delete.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-boot-module/jeecg-boot-module-airag/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/airag/prompts/controller/AiragExtDataController.java#L124-L130", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-airag-extdata-delete"], "aliases": ["GHSA-cvf2-rj3q-wqv8", "CVE-2026-108615"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "26cd2348-8653-3dba-9006-69f9aa80d317", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c8907b26-f905-30e4-9017-06ebbe01f86a", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}